description: Shared models and domain in core
globs: core/**/*.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

# Core (`:core`)

- Pure Kotlin multiplatform: `@Serializable` types, enums, validation helpers — **no** Compose, Koin, Ktor, or SQL.
- Match `backend/data-model/data-model.json`: English fields, ISO 8601 dates, ID references, `GeoPoint`.
- Computed fields documented in model KDoc (`isMinor` from `birthDate`, derived relation sides).
- Keep modules free of Android/iOS-specific APIs; use expect/actual only when unavoidable and minimal.
